<title>USA: Montgomery County, Md., repriced, yields lowered.</title>
<headline>Montgomery County, Md., repriced, yields lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc said Tuesday it repriced Montgomery County Revenue Authority, Md., golf course revenue bonds, lowering yields in several maturities and cutting the top yield in 2022 to 6.33 percent from 6.40 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>MONTGOMERY COUNTY MARYLAND REVENUE AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $10,015,000*</p>
<p>Golf Course System Revenue Bonds</p>
<p>Series 1996 A</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Baa		   S&amp;P: NR</p>
<p>    DATED: 10/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>10/01/1999		  205M    4.85  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2000		  215M    5.05  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2001		  225M    5.25  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2002		  240M    5.35  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2003		  250M    5.45  %	100.00</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>10/01/2004		  265M    5.55  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2005		  280M    5.65  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2006		  295M    5.75  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2007		  315M    5.85  %	100.00</p>
<p>10/01/2008		  330M    5.95  %	100.00</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>10/01/2014		2,450M    6.00  %	  6.233</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 97.5 )</p>
<p>10/01/2022		4,945M    6.125 %	  6.33</p>
<p>						  (Approx. $ Price 97.398)</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 10/01/2006    102.00</p>
<p>		   DTP 10/01/2008</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Wednesday, November 6, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on November 14, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is book entry through DTC.</p>
<p>Alex. Brown &amp; Son Incorporated</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
